  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/d4FB1yW.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"691\" height=\"225\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>Soartex 是一款適用於 Minecraft 的流暢現代 64x 藝術風格材質包。這些紋理最初由 Soar49 製作，並在過去三年間由粉絲持續開發更新。這些材質經過精心設計，兼具細節但不追求照片級寫實；保有有機質感而非卡通化風格。Soartex 有兩個官方延續版本：Fanver 和 Invictus。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:19.6px;line-height:1.3\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoartex.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoartex.net%252fdownloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版下載</a></strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fdl.soartex.net%252f1gakr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoartex.net%252fdownloads%252fmodpacks%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組包下載</a></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoartex.net%252fdownloads%252fmodpacks%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><br>Fanver</strong>&nbsp;</em>是 Soar49 所創 Soartex 材質包的社群延續版本。我們鼓勵粉絲透過論壇提交自製材質，這些投稿會由平面設計師審核，提出友善建議並最終決定更新內容。Fanver 以忠實呈現 Soar49 原創風格著稱，盡可能減少對原始作品的更動。</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">關於再分發與常見問題請造訪：&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoartex.net%252flicense%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://soartex.net/license/<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方 Minecraft 論壇貼文：&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/resource-packs/1237576-1-7-x-x64-soartex-fanver-smooth-and-clean\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/resource-packs/1237576-1-7-x-x64-soartex-fanver-smooth-and-clean<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方 Planet Minecraft 頁面：&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture_pack%252fsoartex-fanver%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.planetminecraft.com/texture_pack/soartex-fanver/<br></a><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">官方 Feed The Beast 貼文：&nbsp;</span><a style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fforum.feed-the-beast.com%252fthreads%252f39834%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://forum.feed-the-beast.com/threads/39834/</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>",
